  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 3.25.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### New Feature\n* feat(compose): support x-okteto-service-account per service by @bgonp in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5184\n* feat(compose): fail fast when an x-okteto-service-account doesn't exist by @bgonp in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5188\n* feat(deploy): deploy dependencies in parallel following depends_on by @jLopezbarb in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5200\n### Bug Fix\n* fix: `okteto destroy` command removes manifest information from config map ev... by @Roshan931 in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5171\n* fix: keep protocol when expanding compose port ranges by @Sarthak-Shreshtha01 in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5178\n* fix: report failed init containers during okteto up by @deepanshupal in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5181\n* fix(build): request a new BuildKit pod when the session's pod is gone by @jLopezbarb in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5189\n* fix: wait until the namespace is fully deleted in `okteto namespace delete` by @jLopezbarb in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5187\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Roshan931 made their first contribution in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5171\n* @Sarthak-Shreshtha01 made their first contribution in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5178\n* @bgonp made their first contribution in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5184\n* @deepanshupal made their first contribution in https://github.com/okteto/okteto/pull/5181\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/okteto/okteto/compare/3.24.1...3.25.0",
